#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:2
msgid "Read A Fragment Interaction Report"
msgstr "阅读片段相互作用能报告"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:4
msgid ""
"The water-dimer calculation gives five interaction energies. Reading them together "
"shows how the method and active space affect the result. This tutorial explains the "
"energy differences and the associated resource estimates."
msgstr "水二聚体计算给出五个相互作用能。将它们一起比较，可以了解方法和活性空间如何影响结果。本教程解释这些能量差异及相关资源估计。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:17
msgid "Start With The Interaction Energy"
msgstr "从相互作用能开始"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:19
msgid ""
"The first table compares five methods for the same water-dimer geometry. Each row "
"gives the counterpoise-corrected interaction energy, :math:`\\Delta E = E(AB) - E(A) "
"- E(B)`. AB denotes the dimer, and A and B denote the two water molecules. All three "
"energies use the dimer basis."
msgstr ""
"第一张表比较同一水二聚体几何下的五种方法。每行给出 counterpoise 校正相互作用能：:math:`\\Delta E = E(AB) - E(A) - "
"E(B)`。AB 表示二聚体，A 和 B 表示两个水分子。三次能量计算都使用二聚体基组。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:27
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:28
msgid "Calculation"
msgstr "计算方法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:29
msgid "ΔE (kcal/mol)"
msgstr "ΔE (kcal/mol)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:30
msgid "HF"
msgstr "HF"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:31
msgid "Hartree–Fock"
msgstr "Hartree–Fock"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:32
msgid "−3.682"
msgstr "−3.682"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:33
msgid "MP2"
msgstr "MP2"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:34
msgid "Second-order Møller–Plesset perturbation theory with a frozen core"
msgstr "冻结芯的二阶 Møller–Plesset 微扰理论"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:35
msgid "−3.935"
msgstr "−3.935"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:36
msgid "CASCI"
msgstr "CASCI"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:37
msgid "Exact diagonalization within the selected active space"
msgstr "在选定活性空间内精确对角化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:38
msgid "−3.574"
msgstr "−3.574"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:39
msgid "SQD"
msgstr "SQD"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:40
msgid "Sample-based quantum diagonalization within the same active space"
msgstr "在同一活性空间内进行基于采样的量子对角化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:41
msgid "−3.557"
msgstr "−3.557"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:42
msgid "CCSD(T)"
msgstr "CCSD(T)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:43
msgid "Coupled cluster with perturbative triples and a frozen core"
msgstr "使用冻结核和微扰三激发的耦合簇方法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:44
msgid "−3.699"
msgstr "−3.699"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:46
msgid ""
"All five values are negative. Each method therefore places the dimer below the "
"separate fragments at this geometry. A more negative value represents a stronger "
"calculated interaction. The spread from −3.935 to −3.557 kcal/mol shows how the "
"result changes with the electronic structure method."
msgstr ""
"五个值均为负值。因此，每种方法都将该几何下二聚体的能量置于独立片段能量之和以下。数值越负，计算得到的相互作用越强。−3.935 至 −3.557 kcal/mol "
"的分布显示了电子结构方法对结果的影响。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:51
msgid ""
"The report shows each energy in Ha and kcal/mol, with six and three decimal places, "
"respectively. A dash means that the calculation has no value for that entry. The "
"adjacent column explains why. For example, ``classical_only`` mode supplies HF and "
"MP2 energies. In ``full`` mode, CCSD(T) runs when its estimated cost fits the "
"calculation budget."
msgstr ""
"报告以 Ha 和 kcal/mol 显示各能量，分别保留六位和三位小数。破折号表示计算未给出该项数值。相邻列说明原因。例如，``classical_only`` 模式提供"
" HF 和 MP2 能量。在 ``full`` 模式中，估计成本符合计算预算时才运行 CCSD(T)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:58
msgid "Compare SQD With CASCI"
msgstr "比较 SQD 与 CASCI"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:60
msgid ""
"CASCI provides an exact solution within the selected active space. SQD approximates "
"that solution in the same space. Their difference therefore measures the SQD "
"algorithm error for this calculation:"
msgstr "CASCI 在选定活性空间内给出精确解。SQD 在同一空间内近似该解。因此，两者之差衡量本次计算的 SQD 算法误差："

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:64
msgid ""
"\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{algorithm}} = \\Delta E_{\\mathrm{SQD}} - \\Delta "
"E_{\\mathrm{CASCI}}."
msgstr ""
"\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{algorithm}} = \\Delta E_{\\mathrm{SQD}} - \\Delta "
"E_{\\mathrm{CASCI}}."

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:68
msgid ""
"The example report gives +0.016 kcal/mol. SQD predicts a slightly less negative "
"interaction energy than CASCI. This comparison isolates the algorithm's contribution "
"because both methods use the same active space."
msgstr "示例报告给出 +0.016 kcal/mol。SQD 预测的相互作用能比 CASCI 略微偏正。由于两种方法使用相同的活性空间，这一比较分离出了算法的贡献。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:72
msgid ""
"The report calculates differences before rounding the energies. Subtracting the "
"rounded table entries can therefore give a slightly different last digit."
msgstr "报告先计算差值，再对能量舍入。因此，直接相减表中已舍入的数值，末位可能略有不同。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:77
msgid "Compare The Active Space With A Larger Calculation"
msgstr "比较活性空间与更大范围的计算"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:79
msgid ""
"The next comparison asks how much the selected active space changes the interaction "
"energy. In this example, the reference is frozen-core CCSD(T) in the full orbital "
"space with the same cc-pVDZ basis:"
msgstr "下一步比较选定活性空间对相互作用能的影响。本例的参考是在全轨道空间中运行的冻结核 CCSD(T)，基组同为 cc-pVDZ："

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:83
msgid ""
"\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{active\\ space}} = \\Delta E_{\\mathrm{CASCI}} - \\Delta "
"E_{\\mathrm{CCSD(T)}}."
msgstr ""
"\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{active\\ space}} = \\Delta E_{\\mathrm{CASCI}} - \\Delta "
"E_{\\mathrm{CCSD(T)}}."

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:87
msgid ""
"This difference is +0.125 kcal/mol. The active-space CASCI calculation predicts a "
"less negative interaction energy than the CCSD(T) reference. Here, this difference "
"exceeds the SQD–CASCI difference. Choosing the active space therefore deserves "
"attention alongside the SQD settings when you refine this calculation."
msgstr ""
"这一差值为 +0.125 kcal/mol。活性空间 CASCI 计算预测的相互作用能比 CCSD(T) 参考偏正。这里的差值大于 SQD–CASCI "
"差值。因此，改进本次计算时，活性空间选择和 SQD 设置都值得关注。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:93
msgid ""
"The report calls this quantity the *active-space error*. It measures the difference "
"from the chosen reference, which here also changes the correlation method. CCSD(T) "
"remains an approximate reference. The source label ``pyscf_ccsd_t`` identifies the "
"CCSD(T) calculation from the same run. If that calculation has no value, q2m3 can use"
" an imported reference with the same basis."
msgstr ""
"报告将这个量称为*活性空间误差*。它衡量相对于选定参考的差异。这里的参考还改变了相关方法。CCSD(T) 仍然是近似参考。来源标签 ``pyscf_ccsd_t`` "
"表示同次运行中的 CCSD(T) 计算。若该计算没有数值，q2m3 可以使用导入的同基组参考。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:101
msgid "Add An External Reference"
msgstr "添加外部参考"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:103
msgid ""
"A reference with another basis extends the comparison beyond the current calculation."
" The report combines it with the same-basis reference to give two further "
"differences:"
msgstr "使用另一基组的参考可以将比较扩展到当前计算之外。报告结合外部参考与同基组参考，给出另外两个差值："

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:110
msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "物理量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:111
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:112
msgid "Basis error"
msgstr "基组误差"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:113
msgid "Same-basis reference − external reference"
msgstr "同基组参考 − 外部参考"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:114
msgid "Model error"
msgstr "模型误差"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:115
msgid "CASCI − external reference"
msgstr "CASCI − 外部参考"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:117
msgid ""
"Each term uses interaction energies. When all references are available, the model "
"error equals the active-space error plus the basis error. The report shows each "
"difference with its sign and its absolute value, in Ha and kcal/mol."
msgstr "各项均使用相互作用能。当所有参考都可用时，模型误差等于活性空间误差加基组误差。报告以 Ha 和 kcal/mol 显示每个差值的有符号值和绝对值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:122
msgid ""
"The water-dimer example supplies no external reference, so these two entries show a "
"dash and ``missing external reference``. To fill them, supply a reference file as "
"described in :ref:`Adapt The Calculation <fragment-adapt-calculation>`. Choose a "
"reference with the same geometry and energy definition. If its method also differs, "
"the reported basis error includes that method difference."
msgstr ""
"水二聚体示例未提供外部参考，所以这两项显示破折号和 ``missing external reference``。若要补全，请按 :ref:`调整计算 "
"<fragment-adapt-calculation>` 提供参考文件。请使用相同几何和能量定义的参考。若参考方法也不同，报告中的基组误差还会包含方法差异。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:130
msgid "Relate The Active Space To Computational Cost"
msgstr "将活性空间与计算成本联系起来"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:132
msgid ""
"The final two tables help plan calculations for the dimer and its monomers. They "
"describe QPE resources and SQD workload separately."
msgstr "最后两张表帮助规划二聚体及其单体的计算。它们分别描述 QPE 资源和 SQD 工作量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:135
msgid ""
"The QPE table estimates the cost of quantum phase estimation with a double-factorized"
" active-space Hamiltonian. It lists the Hamiltonian norm parameter λ in Ha, logical "
"qubits, and Toffoli gates for AB, A, and B. These estimates describe a possible QPE "
"calculation. The energies above come from the electronic structure methods in the "
"first table."
msgstr ""
"QPE 表估计使用双因子分解活性空间哈密顿量时的量子相位估计成本。它列出 AB、A、B 的哈密顿量范数参数 λ（Ha）、逻辑比特数和 Toffoli "
"门数。这些估计描述一种可能的 QPE 计算。上文的能量来自第一张表中的电子结构方法。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:141
msgid "The SQD table connects the active-space size to the simulated workload:"
msgstr "SQD 表将活性空间大小与模拟工作量联系起来："

