#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:167
msgid ""
"SQD uses two qubits per active orbital. The full configuration-interaction (CI) "
"dimension counts the determinants for the active space and its spin populations. RSS "
"means resident set size. The two RSS columns predict peak memory for the prepare and "
"sample stages in decimal MB."
msgstr ""
"SQD 为每个活性轨道使用两个量子比特。全组态相互作用（CI）维数统计该活性空间及其自旋占据下的行列式数目。RSS 表示驻留集大小。两列 RSS 以十进制 MB 预测 "
"prepare 和 sample 阶段的峰值内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:172
msgid ""
"Read these estimates when you choose a larger active space or plan a series of "
"calculations. For an energy comparison, start with the interaction energies and their"
" differences from the selected references."
msgstr "选择更大的活性空间或规划一系列计算时，请参考这些估计。比较能量时，先看相互作用能及其相对于选定参考的差值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:177
msgid "Include Experimental Ks Values"
msgstr "加入实验 Ks 值"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:179
msgid ""
"If you also have experimental Ks values, pass a mapping of labels to values as "
"``ks_table`` in ``render_report``. The report appends them in the supplied order, so "
"collaborators can read the measurements alongside the calculations. Statistical "
"analysis of their relationship to ΔE remains a separate step. The water-dimer example"
" has no Ks table."
msgstr ""
"若还有实验 Ks 值，请在 ``render_report`` 中通过 ``ks_table`` "
"传入标签到数值的映射。报告按传入顺序追加这些值，供合作者将测量值与计算结果一起阅读。它们与 ΔE 之间关系的统计分析仍是独立步骤。水二聚体示例没有 Ks 表。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.rst:9
msgid ""
"You can read the tables below without running Python. To reproduce them, follow "
":doc:`Fragment Interaction Energy <fragment-interaction>` with cc-pVDZ and "
"``mode=\"full\"``. The generated report uses Chinese headings. The explanations below"
" follow its table order."
msgstr ""
"无需运行 Python，即可阅读下列表格。如需复现，请按 :doc:`片段相互作用能 <fragment-interaction>` 使用 cc-pVDZ 和 "
"``mode=\"full\"``。生成的报告使用中文标题。下文按报告中的表格顺序解释结果。"
